# E² Corpus Lineage Index {#original-e2-work}

This registry replaces the archived Notion-export link hub with a compact lineage map for the original E^2 corpus. It is index material, not a theory document. Use it to locate historical anchors and then route claims to the current canonical Context Layer.

## Foundational Ontology {#foundational-ontology}

- `E2 Entry Point.ormd`: human-readable entry point for the relational ontology.
- `E2 Equation.ormd`: provisional composition and recurrence notation.
- `E2 Axioms.ormd`: canonical axiomatic foundation; parents include Initial Axioms.
- `Relational Primitives.ormd`: canonical merged primitive vocabulary; parents include Relational Primitives V3.
- `Resonance and Relational Translation.ormd`: scoped successor to the April 17, April 24, and April 26 resonance works; the dated originals remain in archive lineage.

## Constitutional and Ethical Anchors {#constitutional-ethical-anchors}

- `Constitutions.ormd`: constitution index and early governance framing.
- `Essence of Existence Constitution.ormd`: current constitutional articulation.
- `Declaration of Interdependence.ormd`: interdependence as civic/ethical frame.
- `Ethical Principles for Human-AI Interaction.ormd`: early human-AI ethics anchor.
- `Relational Bill of Rights.ormd`: canonical relational-rights expression.
- `Remnant Stewardship.ormd`: stewardship of remainder, residue, and unintegrated persons/patterns.

## Emergence, Complexity, and Limits {#emergence-complexity-limits}

- `Universal Emergence Pattern.ormd` (archived under `archive/20260928_emergence_synthesis_reconciliation/Context Layer/`): historical emergence-pattern synthesis; its bounded inquiry questions are now in Relational Primitives.
- `Meta-Pattern Decidability Conjecture (MPDC).ormd`: decidability and embedded-observer limit.
- `Truth Ceiling.ormd`: epistemic ceiling and coherence constraints.
- `REMF.ormd` (archived under `archive/20260928_emergence_synthesis_reconciliation/Context Layer/`): historical full-framework synthesis, no longer an active entry point.
- `Emergence Engine.ormd`: generative/simulation lineage.
- `Adaptation via Informational Abstraction.ormd`: abstraction/adaptation account.

## Applied Fields and Domains {#applied-fields-domains}

- `Power as Relational Field Coherence.ormd`: power as relational field coherence.
- `Caregiving as an Ecosystem.ormd`: care as relational ecology.
- `Communication as Coherence.ormd`: communication and coherence repair.
- `Family as a Relational Field.ormd`: implementation/demonstration view of family through the framework lens.
- `Relational Volition.ormd`: volition and agency within relational dynamics.

## Adjacent and Historical Clusters {#adjacent-historical-clusters}

- `Tensional Intelligence: A Theoretical Foundation.ormd`: tension as intelligence substrate.
- `Tensional Navigation: A Practical Framework.ormd`: applied navigation pattern.
- `Ontological Systems Interface (OSI) Model.ormd`: interface model bridging ontology and operational mapping.
- `Eidosemantic Systems Theory.ormd`: semantic/systemic lineage.
- `Maslow, The Bible, and Relationship.ormd`: comparative conceptual anchor.
- `Myth/Story.ormd`, `Tangential Ideas.ormd`, and `People with Related Ideas.ormd`: noncanonical historical/contextual anchors.

## Use Guidance {#use-guidance}

When a reader needs history, start here. When a reader needs a claim, prefer the current canonical document named in the relevant cluster. The archived human export preserves the original Notion link labels, IDs, and order.
